<title>HUNGARY: Danubius Q1 97 pre-tax profit 600.3mln.</title>
<headline>Danubius Q1 97 pre-tax profit 600.3mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Jan-March 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating result	401.2 loss vs    110.1 profit</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	  600.3	vs    149.3</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     3,075.8	vs  2,811.3</p>
<p>    Group other revenues	   35.0	vs    345.7</p>
<p>    Material expenditures     1,208.0	vs 1,005.2</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures    1,307.5	vs 1,112.9</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    267.3	vs   427.9</p>
<p>    Other costs		     472.9	vs   360.9</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    256.7	vs   142.1</p>
<p>    Net financial income	1,003.5 profit vs  41.6 profit</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	 1,107.7	vs    68.3</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure     104.3	vs    26.8</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	2.0 loss vs     2.4 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	 3.3	vs     3.3</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditure   5.3	vs     5.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Danubius Hotels Rt is a hotel chain.</p>
<p>The figures are consolidated, unaudited and were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom =36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
